{"id":737,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Its digestive processes convert the leaves it eats into electricity. An electric sac in its belly stores the electricity for later use."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"While its durable shell protects it from attacks, Charjabug strikes at enemies with jolts of electricity discharged from the tips of its jaws."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its stout shell provides excellent defense from attacks. It uses electricity on persistent opponents."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It buries itself in fallen leaves and barely moves, munching away on humus. If you accidentally step on one, you’ll get a shock!"},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"From the food it digests, it generates electricity, and it stores this energy in its electric sac."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its body is capable of storing electricity. On camping trips, people are grateful to have one around."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Battery","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up ally Pokémon's special moves."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":736,"name":"Grubbin","condition":null,"children":[{"id":737,"name":"Charjabug","condition":"Lv. 20","children":[{"id":738,"name":"Vikavolt","condition":"Level up at Vast Poni Canyon (or 1 other place) or Use Thunder Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,268],[1,11],[1,81],[1,189],[1,450],[15,44],[23,209],[29,564],[36,404],[43,242],[50,91],[57,334],[64,435]],"machine":[226,450,268,451,242,91,598,604,486,527,203,263,334,113,679,341,189,398,884,182,240,156,806,214,522,164,36,851,87,86,85,521,528,404],"egg":[435,106],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv5-169","name":"Charjabug","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"169","artist":"Mina Nakai","img":"sv5/169"},{"id":"me5-25","name":"Charjabug","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"